		(descr "Raspberry Pi RP2354A QFN-60 7x7. Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/RP2350.pdf (RP2350 Datasheet) s14.1.2 Figure 144 'Recommended PCB Footprint for the RP2350 QFN-60 package' (pdf p1329): pads 0.20 x 0.875 at 0.40 pitch, 7.75 outer / 6.00 inner, EP 3.40; RP2354A uses the same QFN-60 (s14.3); pin 1 top-left, counter-clockwise. Figure 144 land with the toe trimmed (heel edge 3.00 kept); EP and paste as _W. DENSE: budget envelope QFN60_7 7.2 vs Figure 144 7.75: outer edge 3.875 -> 3.70 (0.20 past the 7.0 body, IPC-7351B density L toe, as the RTC6705/SX1280 _Dense lands); pads 0.70 x 0.20. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:QFN-60_L7.0-W7.0-P0.40-TL-EP3.4 (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/QFN-60_L7.0-W7.0-P0.40-TL-EP3.4_Dense.json | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 3.56 (D 7 BSC, aaa 0.05 -> 3.525 + 0.035), heel 3.00 kept (Fig 144 inner 6.00; IPC L heel 0 at Smin = 7.0-0.05-2x0.45; verifier restored it from 3.05), width 0.18 = b nom (0.13/0.18/0.23), EP 3.40/paste unchanged")
